The function call `extractCSSInfo(css)` should return the following dictionary:
```python
{
    "sp-50": {
        "width": "100%",
        "height": "50px"
    },
    "sp-10": {
        "width": "100%",
        "height": "10px"
    },
    "el-shl-loading": {
